    and bruised. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Medicine skill and
    the Surgery Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Risky
    Surgery] skill feat."
